        }
      ],
      "extract": "The experimental setup is shown diagrammatically in figure [\\[fig1\\]](#fig1){reference-type=\"ref\" reference=\"fig1\"}a. An electron beam with energy of 600 eV was generated with a thermionic tungsten filament and several electrostatic lenses. The beam was collimated with a slit of 2 $\\mu$m width and 10 $\\mu$m height placed at 16.5 cm. The double-slit was located 30.5 cm from the collimation slit. The resulting",
