      "extract": "The movable mask was placed behind the double-slit, see figure [\\[fig1\\]](#fig1){reference-type=\"ref\" reference=\"fig1\"}. The mask was moved from one side to the other (figure [\\[fig2\\]](#fig2){reference-type=\"ref\" reference=\"fig2\"} top to bottom). Initially the majority of the electrons are blocked. As the mask is moved, slit 1 becomes partially, then fully open. When one slit is open, single-slit diffraction can be",
