      ],
      "extract": "In this paper, we show a full realization of Feynman’s thought experiment and illustrate key features of quatum mechanics: interference and the wave-particle duality of matter. By controlling the transmission through the individual slits of a double-slit we were able to observe the diﬀraction patterns from slit 1 (P1), slit 2 (P2), and both (P12), thus observing the wave properties of electrons. Also, by recording",
